<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="km">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ប្រព័ន្ធគ្រប់គ្រងហាង - KhmerPOS2027</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 font-sans min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-between">
    <header class="bg-white shadow-sm border-b px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xl">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-store"></i>
            </div>
            <div>
                <h1 class="font-bold text-gray-800 text-base">KhmerPOS 2027</h1>
                <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">ប្រព័ន្ធគ្រប់គ្រង និងលក់ទំនិញ</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-2 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-xl border">
    <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-user text-blue-600"></i>
    <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-gray-700">
        <%= locals.user ? user.email : 'ភ្ញៀវ' %>
    </span>
        </div>

    </header>

    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto p-6 w-full my-auto">
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-sm border text-center">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-blue-50 text-blue-600 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 text-4xl">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-shop"></i>
            </div>
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2">សូមស្វាគមន៍មកកាន់ប្រព័ន្ធលក់ Online</h2>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-sm max-w-md mx-auto mb-8">ប្រព័ន្ធត្រូវបានភ្ជាប់ជាមួយ Supabase Database & Auth រួចរាល់។</p>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 max-w-lg mx-auto">
                <a href="/store/SHOP123" class="flex items-center p-4 bg-blue-50 hover:bg-blue-100 border border-blue-200 rounded-2xl transition group text-left">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mr-4">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-cart-shopping"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 text-sm">មើលទំព័រហាង (Store)</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">បញ្ជាទិញ និងបង់ប្រាក់</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
                <a href="/signin" class="flex items-center p-4 bg-emerald-50 hover:bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-200 rounded-2xl transition group text-left">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center text-xl mr-4">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-right-to-bracket"></i>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-800 text-sm">ចូលប្រព័ន្ធ (Sign In)</h3>
                        <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">ចូលកាន់កាប់គណនី</p>
                    </div>
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>

    <footer class="text-center py-4 text-xs text-gray-400">
        © 2026 PACH KROUCH Store. All rights reserved.
    </footer>
</body>
</html>

